<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Wiphold details results of share offer.</title>
<headline>Wiphold details results of share offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women Investment Portfolio Holdings Ltd said on Monday it had received applications for 11.24 million shares of 200 cents each in its offer of B ordinary shares.</p>
<p>It said the minimum subscription of 10 million shares had been achieved and, as a result, no shares had been taken up by the underwriter.</p>
<p>The company said it was currently considering a listing of the shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange and a further announcement in this regard would be made in due course.</p>
